00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:27.040
every day and be consistent. And you

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:29.040
have to not be lazy. And one way to get

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:31.400
over laziness, a quick hack, if you

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:33.360
